     {
      "who": "Prakash",
      "od": "ଧନ୍ଯବାଦ ମାମୁଁ, ମୋତେ ବହୁତ ଭୋକ ଲାଗୁଛି।",
      "tr": "dhanyabada mamun, mote bahut bhoka laguchhi.",
      "en": "Thank you, Uncle, I'm very hungry."
     },
     {
      "who": "Mama",
      "od": "ମାଛ ତରକାରୀ କେମିତି ହୋଇଛି?",
